<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Maior Estudo de Competitividade de Preços do Brasil | BrandTail.AI</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 60 60'><rect width='60' height='60' rx='12' fill='%230B2545'/><path d='M16 14H32a8 8 0 010 16H16ZM16 30H34a8 8 0 010 16H16Z' fill='white'/><path d='M40 46L48 38l0 4 8 0 0 4Z' fill='%23F97316'/></svg>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<!-- ============================================================
  FIREBASE — SDK compat (v10). Troque o firebaseConfig abaixo
  pelas credenciais reais do seu projeto Firebase antes de publicar.
  Sem config real, a página roda em MODO DEMONSTRAÇÃO (leads ficam
  só em memória no navegador, não são persistidos).
============================================================= -->
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.2/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.2/firebase-firestore-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.2/firebase-storage-compat.js"></script>

<style>
:root{
  --navy:#0B2545;--navy-2:#13315C;--navy-deep:#061833;
  --orange:#F97316;--orange-h:#EA580C;
  --silver-2:#F3F4F6;--silver-3:#CBD5E1;
  --ink:#0F172A;--muted:#64748B;--line:#E2E8F0;
  --paper:#FAFAF9;--green:#16A34A;--red:#DC2626;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
body{margin:0;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.5;}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.5px;line-height:1.1;margin:0;}
p{margin:0;}
.container{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;}
.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--orange);font-weight:700;}
.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;}
a{color:inherit;}

/* demo banner */
#demoBanner{display:none;background:var(--navy-deep);color:#FDBA74;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;text-align:center;padding:7px 10px;letter-spacing:.3px;}

header.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px;}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
.brand-mark{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--navy);display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;}
.brand-text{font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:800;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.5px;color:var(--navy);}
.brand-text .ai{color:var(--orange);}
.brand-tag{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;}
.nav-cta{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;}
.nav-cta:hover{background:var(--navy-2);}

/* hero */
.hero{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#13315C 0%,#0B2545 60%,#061833 100%);color:#fff;padding:64px 0 56px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-120px;top:-140px;width:460px;height:460px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(249,115,22,.18),transparent 70%);}
.hero-inner{position:relative;text-align:center;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,50px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:16px 0 14px;}
.hero h1 .hl{color:var(--orange);}
.hero p.lead{color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);font-size:16.5px;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;}

/* audience toggle */
.toggle-wrap{margin:34px auto 0;max-width:420px;display:flex;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:999px;padding:5px;position:relative;}
.toggle-wrap.toggle-wrap-3{max-width:580px;}
.toggle-btn{flex:1;text-align:center;padding:11px 10px;font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);transition:color .15s;user-select:none;position:relative;z-index:1;}
.toggle-wrap-3 .toggle-btn{font-size:12.5px;padding:11px 6px;}
.toggle-btn.active{color:#0B2545;}
.toggle-slider{position:absolute;top:5px;left:5px;width:calc(50% - 5px);height:calc(100% - 10px);background:#fff;border-radius:999px;transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);z-index:0;}
.toggle-wrap-3 .toggle-slider{width:calc(33.333% - 3.334px);}
.toggle-wrap[data-active="seller"] .toggle-slider{transform:translateX(100%);}
.toggle-wrap[data-active="varejista"] .toggle-slider{transform:translateX(200%);}

/* search card */
.search-card{margin-top:26px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px -20px rgba(6,24,51,.55);text-align:left;color:var(--ink);}
.search-card .stat-line{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;}
.search-card .stat-line strong{color:var(--navy);font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:800;}
.search-row{display:flex;gap:10px;position:relative;}
.search-row input{flex:1;padding:15px 18px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-family:'Inter';outline:none;transition:border-color .15s;}
.search-row input:focus{border-color:var(--orange);}
.search-row button{background:var(--orange);color:#fff;border:none;font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;}
.search-row button:hover{background:var(--orange-h);}
.suggest-box{position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 6px);left:0;right:80px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 16px 32px -18px rgba(11,37,69,.35);z-index:10;max-height:260px;overflow-y:auto;display:none;}
.suggest-item{padding:12px 16px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
.suggest-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.suggest-item:hover,.suggest-item.hi{background:var(--silver-2);}
.suggest-item b{color:var(--navy);}

/* results */
#resultZone{display:none;padding:8px 0 0;}
.result-panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:32px;box-shadow:0 16px 40px -24px rgba(11,37,69,.25);}
.result-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-bottom:22px;}
.result-head h3{font-size:22px;color:var(--navy);}
.result-head .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(249,115,22,.12);color:var(--orange);}
.metric-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:26px;}
.metric{background:var(--silver-2);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 16px;}
.metric .v{font-family:'Manrope';font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:-.5px;}
.metric .v.orange{color:var(--orange);}.metric .v.green{color:var(--green);}.metric .v.red{color:var(--red);}
.metric .l{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px;}

.cta-block{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#13315C 0%,#0B2545 60%,#061833 100%);border-radius:16px;padding:28px;color:#fff;text-align:center;}
.cta-block h4{font-size:19px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px;}
.cta-block p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);font-size:14px;max-width:460px;margin:0 auto;}
.btn-primary{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:800;font-size:15px;padding:14px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:none;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 10px 24px -8px rgba(249,115,22,.55);transition:background .15s,transform .15s;}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--orange-h);transform:translateY(-1px);}

.lead-form{max-width:400px;margin:20px auto 0;display:none;text-align:left;}
.lead-form.show{display:block;}
.field{margin-bottom:12px;}
.field label{display:block;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.3px;}
.field input{width:100%;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#fff;font-size:14.5px;font-family:'Inter';outline:none;}
.field input::placeholder{color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);}
.field input:focus{border-color:var(--orange);}
.field .err{display:none;color:#FCA5A5;font-size:12px;margin-top:5px;}
.field.invalid input{border-color:#F87171;}
.field.invalid .err{display:block;}
.field.light label{color:var(--muted);}
.field.light input{background:#fff;border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink);}
.field.light input::placeholder{color:var(--muted);opacity:.7;}
.field.light .err{color:var(--red);}

.submit-err{display:none;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;color:#FCA5A5;margin-top:12px;line-height:1.5;}
.submit-err.show{display:block;}
.submit-err.light{color:var(--red);}

.success-box.light .icon{background:rgba(249,115,22,.12);color:var(--orange);}
.success-box.light h4{color:var(--navy);}
.success-box.light p{color:var(--muted);}

/* varejista card */
.varejista-card{margin-top:26px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px -20px rgba(6,24,51,.55);text-align:left;color:var(--ink);}
.varejista-card .stat-line{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px;}
.benefit-list{list-style:none;margin:0 0 22px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;}
.benefit-list li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5;}
.benefit-list li::before{content:"✓";flex-shrink:0;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(22,163,74,.12);color:var(--green);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-top:1px;}

.not-found{background:var(--silver-2);border-radius:16px;padding:26px;text-align:center;}
.not-found h4{font-size:17px;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px;}
.not-found p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;}

.success-box{text-align:center;padding:10px 0;}
.success-box .icon{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 14px;font-size:24px;}
.success-box h4{color:#fff;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:8px;}
.success-box p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);font-size:14px;max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;}
.download-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:18px;background:#fff;color:var(--navy);font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;}
.download-btn[aria-disabled="true"]{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed;}
.download-note{margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);max-width:380px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}

/* plugin section */
.plugin-sec{padding:80px 0;}
.plugin-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:44px;align-items:center;}
@media(max-width:900px){.plugin-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.plugin-sec h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px);color:var(--navy);margin:10px 0 14px;}
.plugin-sec .problem{color:var(--muted);font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:20px;}
.feat-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;margin-top:22px;}
.feat{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;}
.feat .dot{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:rgba(249,115,22,.12);color:var(--orange);display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:800;font-family:'Manrope';}
.feat .t{font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink);}
.feat .d{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;}
.plugin-visual{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#13315C,#0B2545);border-radius:20px;padding:34px;color:#fff;}
.plugin-visual .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(249,115,22,.16);color:var(--orange);margin-bottom:14px;}
.plugin-visual h3{color:#fff;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.plugin-visual p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.trial-btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:800;font-size:15px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;}
.trial-btn:hover{background:var(--orange-h);}
.trial-note{font-size:11.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);margin-top:10px;}

/* Outros estudos */
.otherstudies-sec{padding:0 0 84px;}
.otherstudies-head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 34px;}
.otherstudies-head h2{font-size:clamp(22px,2.8vw,30px);color:var(--navy);margin:10px 0 0;}
.study-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;}
@media(max-width:900px){.study-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.study-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:26px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 16px 32px -26px rgba(11,37,69,.25);transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s;}
.study-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 20px 40px -22px rgba(11,37,69,.35);}
.study-tag{display:inline-block;align-self:flex-start;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);background:var(--silver-2);padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.study-card h3{font-family:'Manrope';font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:-.3px;}
.study-meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;}
.study-stat{background:var(--silver-2);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;}
.study-stat .v{font-family:'Manrope';font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:var(--orange);letter-spacing:-.5px;}
.study-stat .l{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;}
.study-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px;flex:1;}
.study-substats{display:flex;gap:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px;margin-bottom:18px;}
.study-substats > div{flex:1;}
.study-substats .v{font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:800;font-size:16px;color:var(--navy);}
.study-substats .l{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;}
.study-cta{margin-top:auto;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:13px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;transition:background .15s;}
.study-card:hover .study-cta{background:var(--navy-2);}

/* FAQ */
.faq-sec{padding:0 0 84px;}
.faq-head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 34px;}
.faq-head h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px);color:var(--navy);margin:10px 0 0;}
.faq-list{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;}
.faq-item{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:2px 22px;}
.faq-item summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:18px 0;font-family:'Manrope';font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;color:var(--navy);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;}
.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
.faq-item summary::after{content:"+";flex-shrink:0;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--silver-2);color:var(--orange);font-size:17px;font-weight:800;display:grid;place-items:center;transition:transform .2s;}
.faq-item[open] summary::after{content:"–";}
.faq-item .a{padding:0 0 20px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;}
.faq-item .a b{color:var(--ink);}

footer{background:var(--navy-deep);color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);padding:30px 0;font-size:13px;}
footer .container{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;}
.hidden{display:none !important;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="demoBanner">MODO DEMONSTRAÇÃO — Firebase não configurado. Preencha <code>firebaseConfig</code> no código para gravar leads de verdade. A busca de marcas/sellers já usa a base real do estudo.</div>

<header class="site">
  <div class="container nav">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-mark"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 60 60"><path d="M16 14H32a8 8 0 010 16H16ZM16 30H34a8 8 0 010 16H16Z" fill="white"/><path d="M40 46L48 38l0 4 8 0 0 4Z" fill="#F97316"/></svg></div>
      <div><div class="brand-text">BrandTail<span class="ai">.AI</span></div><div class="brand-tag">Pricing &amp; Trade Solutions</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO + BUSCA ============ -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Estudo de Competitividade</span>
    <h1><span class="hl">Maior estudo</span> de competitividade de preços do Brasil.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Comparamos os preços do site da Droga Raia com Amazon, Pague Menos e Drogaria São Paulo, item a item. Descubra agora como sua marca ou sua loja está posicionada.</p>

    <div class="toggle-wrap toggle-wrap-3" id="toggleWrap" data-active="marca">
      <div class="toggle-slider"></div>
      <div class="toggle-btn active" data-audience="marca">Sou Indústria</div>
      <div class="toggle-btn" data-audience="seller">Sou Seller</div>
      <div class="toggle-btn" data-audience="varejista">Sou Varejista</div>
    </div>

    <div class="search-card" id="searchCard">
      <div class="stat-line" id="statLineMarca">Analisamos a competitividade de <strong>769 marcas</strong>, totalizando <strong>219.270 produtos</strong> e <strong>11.941 produtos comparados</strong>. Pesquise sua marca e obtenha o estudo completo.</div>
      <div class="stat-line hidden" id="statLineSeller">Analisamos a competitividade de <strong>459 sellers</strong>, totalizando <strong>251.109 produtos</strong> e <strong>7.336 produtos comparados</strong>. Pesquise sua loja e obtenha o estudo completo.</div>
      <div class="search-row">
        <input id="searchInput" type="text" placeholder="Digite o nome da sua marca...">
        <div class="suggest-box" id="suggestBox"></div>
        <button id="searchBtn">Buscar</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- VAREJISTA: sem busca — captação direta para levar o In.site para o próprio site -->
    <div class="varejista-card hidden" id="varejistaCard">
      <div class="stat-line">Leve a competitividade em tempo real para dentro do seu próprio site, sem depender de planilha nem de outro time para saber se seu preço está competitivo.</div>

      <ul class="benefit-list">
        <li>Quero pesquisar preços em <strong>TEMPO REAL</strong></li>
        <li>Dar autonomia para qualquer pessoa do time ver os dados da concorrência</li>
        <li>Analisar os dados da concorrência direto no meu site</li>
        <li>Integrar os dados da minha pesquisa de preços no plugin In.site</li>
      </ul>

      <div id="varejistaCtaDefault">
        <button class="btn-primary" id="openVarejistaForm" style="width:100%;">Quero o plugin no meu site</button>
      </div>

      <form class="lead-form" id="leadFormVarejista" onsubmit="return false;">
        <div class="field light" id="fNameVarejista">
          <label>Nome</label>
          <input type="text" placeholder="Seu nome completo" required>
          <div class="err">Informe seu nome.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="field light" id="fCompanyVarejista">
          <label>Empresa</label>
          <input type="text" placeholder="Nome da sua empresa" required>
          <div class="err">Informe o nome da sua empresa.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="field light" id="fEmailVarejista">
          <label>E-mail corporativo</label>
          <input type="email" placeholder="voce@suaempresa.com.br" required>
          <div class="err">Use seu e-mail corporativo (não aceitamos gmail, hotmail, yahoo, etc.).</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;"><button class="btn-primary" type="submit" style="width:100%;">Quero o plugin no meu site</button></div>
        <div class="submit-err light" id="submitErrVarejista">Não conseguimos registrar seu pedido agora. Confira sua conexão e tente novamente.</div>
      </form>

      <div class="success-box light hidden" id="successVarejista">
        <div class="icon">✓</div>
        <h4>Recebemos seu pedido!</h4>
        <p>Nosso time vai entrar em contato para ativar o In.site no seu site.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ RESULTADO ============ -->
<div class="container">
  <div id="resultZone">

    <!-- ENCONTRADO -->
    <div class="result-panel hidden" id="foundPanel">
